{"id":"forecast-18","section":4,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-18/audio-4.mp3","model":"small","duration":234.36,"segments":[{"start":0.14,"end":4.54,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 31 to 40.","words":[["Now",0.14,0.8],["listen",0.8,1.16],["carefully",1.16,1.7],["and",1.7,2.0],["answer",2.0,2.52],["questions",2.52,3.02],["31",3.02,3.88],["to",3.88,4.18],["40.",4.18,4.54]]},{"start":7.98,"end":13.6,"text":"First, a bit of background. In recent years people have been trying to exploit a number","words":[["First,",7.98,8.56],["a",8.9,9.02],["bit",9.02,9.18],["of",9.18,9.32],["background.",9.32,9.62],["In",10.4,10.8],["recent",10.8,11.1],["years",11.1,11.52],["people",11.52,11.82],["have",11.82,12.06],["been",12.06,12.22],["trying",12.22,12.46],["to",12.46,12.66],["exploit",12.66,13.06],["a",13.06,13.3],["number",13.3,13.6]]},{"start":13.6,"end":17.8,"text":"of different renewable forms of energy. One of these is wind power.","words":[["of",13.6,13.78],["different",13.78,14.02],["renewable",14.02,14.6],["forms",14.6,15.16],["of",15.16,15.38],["energy.",15.38,15.74],["One",16.38,16.62],["of",16.62,16.74],["these",16.74,16.86],["is",16.86,17.04],["wind",17.04,17.36],["power.",17.36,17.8]]},{"start":19.6,"end":24.96,"text":"Electricity can be generated from wind power by turbines, and at present large numbers","words":[["Electricity",19.6,19.92],["can",19.92,20.14],["be",20.14,20.3],["generated",20.3,20.72],["from",20.72,21.08],["wind",21.08,21.38],["power",21.38,21.76],["by",21.76,22.04],["turbines,",22.04,22.46],["and",23.18,23.5],["at",23.5,23.6],["present",23.6,23.9],["large",23.9,24.58],["numbers",24.58,24.96]]},{"start":24.96,"end":31.34,"text":"of these tall wind turbines are being erected in what are called wind farms. And the government","words":[["of",24.96,25.28],["these",25.28,25.54],["tall",25.54,26.0],["wind",26.0,26.42],["turbines",26.42,27.0],["are",27.0,27.54],["being",27.54,27.68],["erected",27.68,28.18],["in",28.18,28.3],["what",28.3,2