",79.32,79.52],["birds",79.96,80.32],["are",80.32,80.5],["often",80.5,80.76],["vulnerable",80.76,81.2],["when",81.2,81.54],["they're",81.54,81.82],["setting",81.82,82.0],["off",82.0,82.3],["on",82.3,82.52],["long",82.52,82.78]]},{"start":82.78,"end":89.5,"text":"sea migrations, or when they're flying below cloud. So in my opinion, efforts should be","words":[["sea",82.78,83.08],["migrations,",83.08,83.7],["or",84.14,84.4],["when",84.4,84.58],["they're",84.58,84.78],["flying",84.78,85.0],["below",85.0,85.44],["cloud.",85.44,85.98],["So",86.86,87.22],["in",87.22,87.46],["my",87.46,87.72],["opinion,",87.72,88.04],["efforts",88.6,88.92],["should",88.92,89.3],["be",89.3,89.5]]},{"start":89.5,"end":95.12,"text":"made to site new wind farms responsibly, and that means avoiding low lying areas and narrow","words":[["made",89.5,89.78],["to",89.78,89.96],["site",89.96,90.24],["new",90.24,90.56],["wind",90.56,90.8],["farms",90.8,91.12],["responsibly,",91.12,91.98],["and",92.48,92.66],["that",92.66,92.8],["means",92.8,93.0],["avoiding",93.0,93.36],["low",93.36,93.8],["lying",93.8,94.1],["areas",94.1,94.52],["and",94.52,94.82],["narrow",94.82,95.12]]},{"start":95.12,"end":105.84,"text":"valleys between mountains or hills. Now I'd like to look at some specific studies. Firstly,","words":[["valleys",95.12,95.58],["between",95.58,95.92],["mountains",95.92,96.4],["or",96.4,96.72],["hills.",96.72,97.04],["Now",102.42,102.62],["I'd",102.62,102.92],["like",102.92,103.04],["to",103.04,103.24],["look",103.24,103.36],["at",103.36,103.5],["some",103.5,103.74],["specific",103.74,104.2],["studies.",104.2,104.58],["Firstly,",105.46,105.84]]},{"start":106.36,"end":112.0,"text":"a project looking at one particular species of bird, the vulture. This investigation","words":[["a",106.36,106.56],["project",106.56,106.84],["looking",106.84,107.2],["at",107.2,107.48],["one",107.48,107.66],["particular",107.66,108.0],["species",108.0,108.46],["of",108.46,108.76],["bird,",108.76,109.0],["the",109.62,10